{"unit_id":"jihaoran222__dsh-violet-heart#feature-1","repo":"jihaoran222/dsh-violet-heart","commit":"6b52337d340416298995fa750efe90f24810a1fa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-violet-heart 的功能「注册写作规则」：向 DSH 的 systemPrompt 服务注册名为 violet-heart、排序值为 8000 的固定提示词段落。启用后，该规则随系统提示词提供正式文件与个人文档的写作约定。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:40-78","lib/index.js:88-94"]}
